    "text": "──お泊り会、今回で何回目だっけ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400106006/4001060060180"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001060060190,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400106006/4001060060190"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001060060200,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "……特別回とか突発回とか、\r\nそういうのも含めたら……えっと……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400106006/4001060060200"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001060060210,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……それなら、オンラインお泊り会も数に含む？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400106006/4001060060210"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001060060220,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "あれはほぼ普通の通話だったけど",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400106006/4001060060220"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001060060230,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "みんな、寝る時に切っちゃったもんね……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400106006/4001060060230"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001060060231,
    "speaker": "真乃＆灯織",
    "text": "ふふ……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400106006/4001060060231"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "00000",
